  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have a unique natural property like certain desert plants that allows you to retain water for an extended period of time. This grants you a measure of protection against extreme desert conditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Mandragorans or Shenxue with plant-like aspect only.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can survive a number of days without water equal to your Constitution score before suffering ill effects. Mandragorans with this feat no longer suffer from a vulnerability to fire.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc64\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
